    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d583">

                <pb facs="0823" n="803" sameAs="frus:frus1864p2/pg803"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Lord Lyons.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-11-22"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November</hi> 22, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to enclose an extract from
                    a communication of the 17th instant, addressed to the department by his
                    excellency the governor of Vermont, relative to the hostile schemes of insurgent
                    agents in Canada againstthe United States. <pb facs="0824" n="804"
                        xml:id="pg804"/> I must request your lordship to ask the earnest attention
                    of her Britannic Majesty’s government to the subject.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with high consideration, my lord, your obedient
                    servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Right Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lord Lyons</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d583-a1.xml" xpointer="d583-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
